    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PAA\nConquest\nof the Pacific\nMAY 1935\nNAVY MASS FLIGHT\nHAWAII TO MIDWAY ISLAND AND RETURN\nAAMG TO*/234\nCOVERCARRiED ON FLEET MANEUVERS INVOLVING FIVE NAVY PATROL\nSQUADRONS AND 43 AIRCRAFT BETWEEN PEARL HARBOR AND MIDWAY IS\nNITH STOP-OVER AT FRENCH FRIGATE SHOALS. COVER SHOWN DISPATLHED\nFRONA MIDWAY AN MAY 23 VIA PATROL SQUADRON FOUR, ARRiViNG AT\nPEARL HARBOR ON MAY 24 (BACKSTAMA•",
      "Cachet by Courtesy of\nWest Coast Airmail Society\nSan Francisco, Calif\n• 57\n991*\nBUSE FEEL\nMAY. 24\n(930pM)\n11935\nA BALL\n80\n2012\n10\n2310",
      "U\n.S.S.\nMAY\nzU\n1955\nA.M.\nBEAVER\nVUESPOSAD:\nMIDWAY\nMIDWAY\nMAY 11 1935\nThis souvenir cover dispatched by air-plane\nin the direction as indicated by the postal\nmarking through the courtesy of the carrier\nand Mr. H. P. Butler, Superintendent, Com-\nmercial Pacific Cable Company, Midway\nIsland, North Pacific Ocean.\nSuperintend\nNavigator\nPilot\n4-p.\nRadioman\n1 Craig\n*0\n8\nJUNLI\n9 AM\nVIA AIR MAK\nH. L. Waka,\nMAIL"
    ],
